# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.
# This is a placeholder key.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.
# IMPORTANT: Uncomment the line below if your app uses the Gemini API.
# If left commented out, the key will NOT be packaged in the APK.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY

# BRSAPI_KEY: free API key from https://brsapi.ir for live gold/currency/crypto rates
# (used by FinancialRepository.refreshMarketData()). Get your own key at brsapi.ir and
# put it in your local .env file (never commit the real key — .env is already gitignored).
# This default value here just keeps the build working if .env is missing; the app will
# fall back to offline/local rates if the key is invalid or empty.
# NOTE: BRSAPI_KEY is deliberately NOT here. The Android app no longer talks to BrsApi.ir
# directly — it calls our Cloudflare Worker proxy instead (see /brsapi-proxy). The real
# BrsApi key lives ONLY as a `wrangler secret` on that worker, never in this Android project,
# so it can never end up compiled into the APK.

# PROXY_BASE_URL: your deployed Cloudflare Worker URL (see /brsapi-proxy/README.md).
# Example: https://brsapi-proxy.your-subdomain.workers.dev
